== completeness audit
   Rewrites PACKET_COMPLETENESS_MATRIX.json. A family merged since the last audit has no counters, and the raster gate refuses it as "no completeness audit" however finished its packet is.

== product wiring
   A declared product wiring is the fourth condition of the terminal transition. Without it a family with a PASS, a bound RASTER_PASS and no legal input stops at VERIFIED_PASS.

== generate (first pass)
   Derives every family state from the records above and writes the dispatch.

== raster queue
   Enrols newly eligible families and folds admitted receipts into their rows. Reads the queue the first pass just wrote.
